0: Momentary;
1: Latch;
2  Mute output in bypass;

Selects the model loaded for Effect 1 ;
NOTE: The six values that correspond to the category that is currently in use with
Effect 2 will not perform any action for Effect 1 ; 
0 - 5 = Delay models ;
6 - 11 = Modulation models ;
12 - 17 = Pitch / Filter models ;
18 - 23 = Reverb models ;

Selects the model loaded for Effect 2 ;
NOTE: The six values that correspond to the category that is currently in use with
Effect 1 will not perform any action for Effect 2 ; 
0 - 5 = Delay models ;
6 - 11 = Modulation models ;
12 - 17 = Pitch / Filter models ;
18 - 23 = Reverb models ;

Controls position of Effect 2, before (Pre) the Amp Voicing or after (Post) ;
0 - 63 = Pre ;
64 - 127 = Post ;

Controls bypass state of Expression ;
0 - 63 = Off ; 
64 - 127 = On ;

Controls position of the Volume Pedal, before (Pre) the Amp Voicing or after (Post) ;
0 - 63 = Pre ; 
64 - 127 = Post ;

Controls position of Effect 1, before (Pre) the Amp Voicing or after (Post) ;
0 - 63 = Pre ; 
64 - 127 = Post ;

Toggles FX Loop On/Off (regardless of jack sensing) ;
0 - 63 = Off ; 
64 - 127 = On ;
